OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright spells to start the day.
OL,6,FBlustery showers initially along the
OL,7,Fsouth coast, then spreading across the
OL,8,Fregion during the day, some heavy with
OL,9,Fhail and thunder possible.
OL,10,FTemperatures near the seasonal average
OL,11,Fand feeling warm in any sunny spells.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers gradually fading
OL,14,Fduring the evening but some lighter
OL,15,Fones continuing overnight. Clear
OL,16,Fspells developing in between with
OL,17,Fwinds easing. Less muggy than recent
OL,18,Fnights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,171,160,301,260,100,100
