OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F170A1787183723
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FFine for much of Friday with
OL,6,Fsunny spells and variable cloud.
OL,7,FMostly dry but some isolated showers
OL,8,Fpossible along the coast and then more
OL,9,Fbroadly into the evening. Feeling
OL,10,Ffresher.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,13,FBecoming more settled with an
OL,14,Fincreasing number of sunny spells.
OL,15,FSmall chance of a shower on Saturday.
OL,16,FTemperatures below average for August
OL,17,Fbut feeling pleasant where the
OL,18,Fsunshine emerges.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
